          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.294,
            0.749,
            0.364
          ],
          "content": "**1. Convert the following fractions into decimals: (a)** $\\frac { 5 } { \\mathbf { 1 0 0 } }$ **(b)** $\\frac { \\mathbf { 1 6 } } { \\mathbf { 1 0 0 0 } }$ **(c)** $\\frac { \\mathbf { 1 2 } } { \\mathbf { 1 0 } }$ **(d)** $\\frac { 2 5 4 } { \\mathbf { 1 0 0 0 } }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.377,
            0.81,
            0.44
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** (a) $\\frac{5}{100} = 0.05$ (b) $\\frac{16}{1000} = 0.016$ (c) $\\frac { 1 2 } { 1 0 } = 1 . 2$ (d) $\\frac{254}{1000} = 0.254$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.46,
            0.239,
            0.478
          ],
          "content": "**Page No. 79**"
