        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.494,
            0.871,
            0.558
          ],
          "content": "**2. Convert the following decimals into a sum of tenths, hundredths and thousandths: (a) 0.34 (b) 1.02 (c) 0.8 (d) 0.362**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.575,
            0.69,
            0.684
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** (a) $\\frac { 3 } { 1 0 } + \\frac { 4 } { 1 0 0 }$ (b) $\\scriptstyle { \\frac { 1 0 0 } { 1 0 0 } } + { \\frac { 2 } { 1 0 0 } } = 1 + { \\frac { 2 } { 1 0 0 } }$ (c) $\\frac { 8 } { 1 0 }$ (d) $\\frac{3}{10} + \\frac{6}{100} + \\frac{2}{1000}$"
        },
